  "term": "Compazine",
  "definition": "Compazine refers to prochlorperazine maleate, a synthetic phenothiazine drug. It has antiemetic and antipsychotic effects and also has antihistaminic and anticholinergic actions, partly by blocking dopamine D2 receptors in the brain.",
